{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於今日下午6時45分發出偏北強風警告，提醒市民注意即時天氣情況。本港現時吹偏北強風，海面可能出現大浪，對海上活動構成危險。市民應避免前往海邊或參與水上活動，並確保家中窗戶緊閉以減少風力影響。\n</p>\n<p>此外，駕駛人士需特別留意道路安全，尤其是在高地或橋樑上行駛時，應減速並保持穩定。天文台建議市民密切留意最新天氣報告，並採取必要的安全措施以保障自身及家人安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b7%e9%a2%a8%e8%ad%a6%e5%91%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">強風警告</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 9 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:43:02.778019+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:30:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:18.576280+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:47.166684+00:00","content_hash":"6328894556786bd7dface5ff64a4a30e5e517b2e553b60726616c62ac0cd7312","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}